# Docker build context allowlist for the Fly API image (built from the
# repo root; see server/Dockerfile). The image needs only the server
# app and the shared data/ tables, so everything else (frontend, the
# vendored planner submodule, git history, reference assets) is
# excluded to keep the remote build context small and fast to upload.
*
!server
!data

# Re-exclude things that live under the allowed dirs but must not ship.
server/node_modules
**/*.db
**/*.db-shm
**/*.db-wal
**/*.log
.env
